---
title: "Kontakt"
eyebrow: "Wir freuen uns auf dich"
lead: "Adresse, Öffnungszeiten und Ansprechpartner im KGV Sorgenfrei."
description: "Kontakt und Adresse des KGV Sorgenfrei e.V. in Herne-Wanne, Öffnungszeiten des Vereinsheims sowie Namen und Rollen des Vorstands."
layout: layouts/page.njk
schema:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "Organization"
  "name": "Kleingärtnerverein Sorgenfrei Wanne-Eickel e.V."
  "url": "https://www.kgv-sorgenfrei.de"
  "email": "info@kgv-sorgenfrei.de"
  "address":
    "@type": "PostalAddress"
    "streetAddress": "Wilhelmstr. 80"
    "postalCode": "44649"
    "addressLocality": "Herne"
    "addressCountry": "DE"
---

<div class="not-prose grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
  <div class="card p-6">
    <h2 class="mt-0 text-xl text-leaf-800">Adresse</h2>
    <address class="mt-3 not-italic leading-relaxed text-coal-700">
      {{ site.fullName }}<br>
      {% for line in site.address.lines %}{{ line }}<br>{% endfor %}
    </address>
    <a
      class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-leaf-700 hover:text-leaf-800"
      href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query={{ site.address.mapsQuery | urlencode }}"
      rel="noopener"
      target="_blank"
    >Route planen →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="card p-6">
    <h2 class="mt-0 text-xl text-leaf-800">Kontaktdaten</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-coal-700">
      <li><span class="font-medium">1. Vorsitzender:</span> Hans-Peter Müller</li>
      <li><span class="font-medium">Mobil:</span> <a class="text-leaf-700 hover:text-leaf-800" href="tel:{{ site.phoneChair | replace(' ', '') }}">{{ site.phoneChair }}</a></li>
      <li><span class="font-medium">Vorstand:</span> <a class="text-leaf-700 hover:text-leaf-800" href="mailto:{{ site.vorstandEmail }}">{{ site.vorstandEmail }}</a></li>
      <li><span class="font-medium">Allgemeine Anfragen:</span> <a class="text-leaf-700 hover:text-leaf-800" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Öffnungszeiten Vereinsheim</h2>
<ul class="not-prose mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
  {% for slot in site.openingHours %}
  <li class="card p-5">
    <p class="font-semibold text-coal-800">{{ slot.label }}</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-coal-600">{{ slot.time }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2 id="vorstand">Der Vorstand</h2>
<div class="not-prose mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
  {% for member in vorstand %}
  <div class="card flex flex-col items-center gap-3 p-5 text-center">
    {% if member.photo %}
    {% image member.photo, member.name, "h-24 w-24 rounded-sm object-cover", "96px" %}
    {% else %}
    <img src="/assets/images/vorstand-platzhalter.svg" alt="" class="h-24 w-24 rounded-sm object-cover" aria-hidden="true">
    {% endif %}
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-coal-800">{{ member.name }}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-coal-400">{{ member.role }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<div class="not-prose mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-6 rounded-sm bg-leaf-50 p-6 ring-1 ring-leaf-200 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">WhatsApp-Community</h2>
    <p class="leading-relaxed text-coal-700">
      Über unsere „Sorgenfrei-Community“ bei WhatsApp informieren wir schnell und einfach über Geschehnisse im Verein.
      Fragen dazu gerne per Mail an <a class="text-leaf-700 underline decoration-leaf-300 underline-offset-2 hover:text-leaf-800" href="mailto:{{ site.whatsappEmail }}">{{ site.whatsappEmail }}</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-coal-600">Community per Klick beitreten oder QR-Code mit dem Smartphone scannen.</p>
    <a
      class="btn-primary"
      href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/EA1ajXiw7cCHjXQ2tesd4I"
      rel="noopener"
      target="_blank"
    >WhatsApp-Community beitreten</a>
  </div>
  <img
    src="/assets/images/whatsapp-community-qr.svg"
    alt="QR-Code zum Beitritt der WhatsApp-Community des KGV Sorgenfrei"
    width="160"
    height="160"
    class="h-40 w-40 shrink-0 rounded-sm bg-white p-2 ring-1 ring-leaf-200"
    loading="lazy"
  >
</div>
